Cassian Drake is a burly, heavily tattooed human with a broken nose and a shaved head, about the height of [[Org/The Scale/People/Lance Vesper|Lance Vesper]] but far heavier built, and the likely source of Lance’s oversized uniform. He wears tactical greaves and carries a long-barreled rifle, which he spins on its stock.

Cassian is a member of [[Org/The Scale/index|The Scale]], an overseer of the troop under [[Org/The Scale/People/Ralph Bishop|Bishop]]. He answers the door of the troop’s forward base with a rifle through the opening, and he hears the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]].
